  "long_but_definitional": {
    "iso_index": "Twenty-three lines of which the statement is twenty and the proof is five: a five-clause conjunction, each clause quoted from a theorem proved elsewhere in the package and applied by name.  Its length measures the number of clauses, not the amount of work, so the line bound is the wrong instrument here.  The exception is listed rather than the bound raised, so that it is visible and countable; test_census.py requires this list to stay at or below one entry."
