  "note": "The FW-DEF census of this rung, TOTAL over every theorem of the package. The four classes are rung three's, with rung three's meanings. RECONSTRUCTION: not this rung's work, reproduced verbatim under a pin -- every theorem of Kernel.lean, IsoKernel.lean, Inherited.lean and IndexSlice.lean. DEFINITION: true by unfolding, by rfl, by a projection, by one rewrite, by kernel computation over a concrete regime, by pure case exhaustion, or by assembling neighbours into a conjunction or an existential; never counted as content. THIN: one genuine step, or a direct corollary of a neighbour, including a kernel computation read through a neighbour's soundness; counted apart from CONTENT so the headline is not inflated by one-liners. CONTENT: everything else. test_census.py checks this file is total over the package in both directions, that no row classed DEFINITION has a long proof outside long_but_definitional, and that the classes here are scored against the frozen prediction in PREDICTIONS.md."
